msgid "Room service cannot run: the path for its socket is too long ({path})"
msgstr ""
"Room service no puede funcionar: la ruta de su socket es demasiado larga "
"({path})"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/room_service.rs:557
msgid ""
"this SAM was built without its static room helper, so Room service is off"
msgstr ""
"este SAM se compiló sin su ayudante estático de salas, así que Room service "
"está desactivado"

#: crates/sam-runner/src/sound_relay.rs:114
